{"id":"3dca9eb003d33d86","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-negative-translation-stability.md","title":"负翻译公式的直觉主义稳定性","display":"lem-negative-translation-stability — 负翻译公式的直觉主义稳定性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-negative-translation-stability","aliases":["72-lem-negative-translation-stability"],"display":"lem-negative-translation-stability — 负翻译公式的直觉主义稳定性","depends_on":["[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §2.1, print342/PDF354; local intuitionistic derivation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-negative-translation-stability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-negative-translation-stability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-negative-translation-stability — 负翻译公式的直觉主义稳定性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §2.1, print342/PDF354; local intuitionistic derivation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^N\">\\(A^N\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_0^\\omega\\vdash\">\\(H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a> 的实际演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg B:=B\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg B:=B\\to\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>断言保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的原自由参数，不在外层额外全称闭合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\neg\\neg A^N\\to A^N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\neg\\neg A^N\\to A^N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只需直觉主义逻辑。任意否定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg B\">\\(\\neg B\\)</span> 稳定：由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg\\neg B\">\\(\\neg\\neg\\neg B\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg B\">\\(\\neg\\neg B\\)</span>，再得矛盾。故原子双重否定、否定形式的析取与存在翻译稳定；假公式稳定，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\to\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\to\\bot\\)</span> 可证。稳定性对合取封闭；对蕴涵，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg(C\\to D)\">\\(\\neg\\neg(C\\to D)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg D\">\\(\\neg\\neg D\\)</span>，再用后件稳定性得到D；对全称，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg\\forall xC\">\\(\\neg\\neg\\forall xC\\)</span> 推出每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg C\">\\(\\neg\\neg C\\)</span>，逐点稳定后概括。全称引入的变量不在未解除假设的自由变量中，按规则必要改名即可。没有在一般公式上增加双重否定消去。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega$，$A^N$ 取 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]；$H_0^\\omega\\vdash$ 是 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]] 的实际演算，$\\neg B:=B\\to\\bot$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega$，$A^N$ 取 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]；$H_0^\\omega\\vdash$ 是 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]] 的实际演算，$\\neg B:=B\\to\\bot$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A^N","display":false},{"tex":"H_0^\\omega\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg B:=B\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"H_0^\\omega\\vdash\\neg\\neg A^N\\to A^N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg B","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\neg\\neg B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\neg B","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\neg(C\\to D)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\neg D","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\neg\\forall xC","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\neg C","display":false}],"bytes":1765,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-344","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-negative-translation-stability|lem-negative-translation-stability — 负翻译公式的直觉主义稳定性]]"},{"id":"bab89dfdb11ed6dd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0dfc104a5d3297ad","b4e2c27ac178897e"]}